      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write an improved version of the test with better understandability — removing all unused imports, unused data provider methods, and keeping only what's needed for the focused test.Now I'll compile-check the test.The test compiled successfully. The improved version strips all unused imports and unused data-provider methods, retains only the single focused test with a clarifying comment explaining why `MINUTE_OF_DAY` is unsupported, and formats the `assertThrows` call for readability."
